{"verse_key": "13:14", "surah": 13, "verse": 14, "text_uthmani": "لَهُۥ دَعْوَةُ ٱلْحَقِّ ۖ وَٱلَّذِينَ يَدْعُونَ مِن دُونِهِۦ لَا يَسْتَجِيبُونَ لَهُم بِشَىْءٍ إِلَّا كَبَـٰسِطِ كَفَّيْهِ إِلَى ٱلْمَآءِ لِيَبْلُغَ فَاهُ وَمَا هُوَ بِبَـٰلِغِهِۦ ۚ وَمَا دُعَآءُ ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ إِلَّا فِى ضَلَـٰلٍ", "translation": "To Him [alone] is the supplication of truth. And those they call upon besides Him do not respond to them with a thing, except as one who stretches his hands toward water [from afar, calling it] to reach his mouth, but it will not reach it [thus].<sup foot_note=196551>1</sup> And the supplication of the disbelievers is not but in error [i.e., futility].", "verse_from_ms": 337460, "verse_to_ms": 367160, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/13.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "لَهُۥ", "start_ms": 337460, "end_ms": 338320}, {"i": 1, "text": "دَعْوَةُ", "start_ms": 338320, "end_ms": 339140}, {"i": 2, "text": "ٱلْحَقِّ", "start_ms": 339140, "end_ms": 340910}, {"i": 3, "text": "ۖ", "start_ms": 340910, "end_ms": 342050}, {"i": 4, "text": "وَٱلَّذِينَ", "start_ms": 342050, "end_ms": 343040}, {"i": 5, "text": "يَدْعُونَ", "start_ms": 343040, "end_ms": 343790}, {"i": 6, "text": "مِن", "start_ms": 343790, "end_ms": 344820}, {"i": 7, "text": "دُونِهِۦ", "start_ms": 344820, "end_ms": 345230}, {"i": 8, "text": "لَا", "start_ms": 345230, "end_ms": 346820}, {"i": 9, "text": "يَسْتَجِيبُونَ", "start_ms": 346820, "end_ms": 347970}, {"i": 10, "text": "لَهُم", "start_ms": 347970, "end_ms": 348870}, {"i": 11, "text": "بِشَىْءٍ", "start_ms": 348870, "end_ms": 349630}, {"i": 12, "text": "إِلَّا", "start_ms": 349630, "end_ms": 350790}, {"i": 13, "text": "كَبَـٰسِطِ", "start_ms": 350790, "end_ms": 351740}, {"i": 14, "text": "كَفَّيْهِ", "start_ms": 351740, "end_ms": 352180}, {"i": 15, "text": "إِلَى", "start_ms": 352180, "end_ms": 354500}, {"i": 16, "text": "ٱلْمَآءِ", "start_ms": 354500, "end_ms": 355410}, {"i": 17, "text": "لِيَبْلُغَ", "